    ['Cloudflare quick tunnels returned 530 while the local bridge worked', 'We had a working local bridge but n8n still could not reach it.', 'We discovered the route between cloud and local was the weak point.', 'We documented persistent tunnel setup instead of trusting random quick URLs.', 'Automation is only reliable when every system boundary is reliable.'],
    ['The MP4 branch looked connected but n8n needed nested connection arrays', 'We thought the workflow was connected because the nodes existed.', 'We discovered the JSON shape was wrong even though the UI looked close.', 'We rebuilt the branch with exact nested n8n connection arrays.', 'In automation, structure is behavior. A tiny connection shape can stop the whole system.'],
