    ['Fixing one branch exposed another hidden workflow dependency', 'We fixed one visible break and expected the pipeline to work.', 'We discovered the next node depended on a different data shape.', 'We traced the whole path instead of patching one node at a time.', 'The last step usually fails because earlier assumptions were never tested end to end.'],
